# 조선시대 역사 인스턴스 데이터

# 가 (물품)
hist:Institution_가 rdf:type hist:Institution .
hist:Institution_가 rdfs:label "가" .
hist:Institution_가 hist:hasFunction "죄수의 목에 채우는 형구" .
hist:Institution_가 hist:hasPurpose "형벌 집행에 사용" .
hist:Document_옥관령 rdf:type hist:Document .
hist:Document_옥관령 rdfs:label "옥관령" .
hist:Person_정조 rdf:type hist:Person .
hist:Person_정조 rdfs:label "정조" .
hist:Nation_조선 rdf:type hist:Nation .
hist:Nation_조선 rdfs:label "조선" .
hist:Person_정조 hist:reformed hist:Institution_가 .
hist:Institution_가 hist:affiliatedWith hist:Nation_조선 .


